OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I was born while my mother was in
OL,4,Aan iron lung'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 1956, Elizabeth Mennell was 32 with
OL,7,Fan impressive career in the foreign
OL,8,Foffice. She loved the outdoors,
OL,9,Fespecially hiking and swimming, and she
OL,10,Fwas also five months pregnant with her
OL,11,Fsecond child.
OL,13,FThen one day, she caught polio. She was
OL,14,Fparalysed and stayed in hospital for
OL,15,Fthree years, much of which was spent in
OL,16,Fan iron lung - a horizontal metal
OL,17,Fcylinder that patients would lie inside
OL,18,Fto help them breathe.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
