OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1790490367
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I was born while my mother was in
OL,4,Aan iron lung'
OL,5,
OL,6,FElizabeth's daughter, Susan Mennell,
OL,7,Fwho is now 70 and from Bookham in
OL,8,FSurrey, said her mother "apparently
OL,9,Fgave birth to me in an iron lung,"
OL,10,Falthough it was probably opened for the
OL,11,Fdelivery.
OL,13,F"Polio affected her legs, her arms and
OL,14,Falso her intercostal muscles, meaning
OL,15,Fshe couldn't breathe properly without
OL,16,Fassistance. My brother was 18 months
OL,17,Fold at the time, so that was quite an
OL,18,Fupheaval for the family," Susan
OL,19,Fexplained.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
